                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Bowen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-04-07"><hi rendition="#italic">April 7,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay directs that inquiries be made into fact and circumstances of alleged
                    firing upon steamer of New York and Bermudez Company in San Juan River.)</p>
            </div>
